    "title": "Bitcoin Price Falls 14% in a Week to $65,000 as Weekend Selling Breaks Friday’s Low",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-crashes-13-percent-65600",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bitcoin-Price-Craters-Over-13-in-a-Week-to-65500-as-Weekend-Selling-Breaks-Fridays-Low.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-crashes-13-percent-65600\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Falls 14% in a Week to $65,000 as Weekend Selling Breaks Friday&#8217;s Low</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin price crashed about 13% over the past week and traded near $65,600 on Saturday.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-crashes-13-percent-65600\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Falls 14% in a Week to $65,000 as Weekend Selling Breaks Friday&#8217;s Low</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Bitcoin-Price-Craters-Over-13-in-a-Week-to-65500-as-Weekend-Selling-Breaks-Fridays-Low.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-crashes-13-percent-65600\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Falls 14% in a Week to $65,000 as Weekend Selling Breaks Friday&#8217;s Low</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin price crashed about 13% over the past week and traded near $65,600 on Saturday.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/markets/bitcoin-price-crashes-13-percent-65600\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Price Falls 14% in a Week to $65,000 as Weekend Selling Breaks Friday&#8217;s Low</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
