    "title": "Joe Carlasare on “Extreme Fear” in Bitcoin: “I’m A Buyer Here”",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QlieBet41X0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/QlieBet41X0/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here-QlieBet41X0.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joe Carlasare on “Extreme Fear” in Bitcoin: “I’m A Buyer Here”</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin went from 57,000 to 82,000 in less than 90 days earlier this year, and Joe Carlasare says that's why he rejects the idea that capital can't flood back in.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joe Carlasare on “Extreme Fear” in Bitcoin: “I’m A Buyer Here”</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QlieBet41X0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/QlieBet41X0/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here-QlieBet41X0.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joe Carlasare on “Extreme Fear” in Bitcoin: “I’m A Buyer Here”</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin went from 57,000 to 82,000 in less than 90 days earlier this year, and Joe Carlasare says that's why he rejects the idea that capital can't flood back in.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/joe-carlasare-on-extreme-fear-in-bitcoin-im-a-buyer-here\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joe Carlasare on “Extreme Fear” in Bitcoin: “I’m A Buyer Here”</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
